Based on this, I don't think this method is needed.  We are not going to get new chassis from EM events as mentioned in a previous comment.  We can get them all when the PSU app starts and calls initializeChassisList().

The Chassis class should get its presence in its constructor and also add a PropertyChanged listener so it knows when its presence changes.

Then when Chassis methods are called, it can basically do
```
if (present)
{
  ... Do the thing
}
```
